PRO-FORMA FIRST PARTNERS RESOLUTION

The undersigned partners of the proposed [Entity Name] Limited Partnership hereby unanimously resolve as follows:

WHEREAS the partners intend to carry on the business of manufacturing polyresin vacuum casting and hand-painted limited edition statues;

RESOLVED that the limited partnership be formed under the Partnership Act (British Columbia) with the name [Proposed Name] Limited Partnership;

RESOLVED that the registered office of the partnership shall be at [Full Address], British Columbia, Canada;

RESOLVED that the initial partners and their respective capital contributions shall be: [Partner 1 Name] contributing CAD [Amount], [Partner 2 Name] contributing CAD [Amount];

RESOLVED that [General Partner Name] be appointed as the general partner with full power and authority to manage the affairs of the partnership;

RESOLVED that the books and records of the partnership shall be kept at the registered office;

RESOLVED that this resolution shall take effect upon the filing of the Limited Partnership Registration with BC Registry Services.

This resolution was passed by unanimous consent of all partners on [Date].
